      <div xml:id="gom-IIsam4">
        <head xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Hd1e98">Caput 4</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-IIsam4-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIsam4_2">Duo autem viri. (RAB. in lib. Reg., <pb ed="#P" n="0565D"/> tom. II.)</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Hi duo viri principes erant in exercitu Isboseth, et mortuo Abner, sicut tradunt Hebraei, consiliati sunt cum Miphiboseth ut Isboseth interficerent, et ipsum regem constituerent. Sed Miphiboseth consilium prodidit; ideo sic inducitur: <quote xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Qd1e113" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIsam4_4@1-8">Erat autem Jonathae filius pedibus debilis.</quote> Illi vero timore perterriti fugerunt in Gethaim, fueruntque ibi usque ad tempus illud, quo scilicet inde reversi domum Isboseth ingressi sunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-IIsam4-d1e117">
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Qd1e119" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIsam4_2">Et ostiaria.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Rd1e124"><name xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Nd1e125" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIsam4-Qd1e128"><seg type="qs">Ostiaria triticum purgat</seg>; etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ne eam hostes penetrent foramine neglectae cogitationis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
